*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : LON0014
*> PURPOSE : LOAN LIMITS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-01-10 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-08 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 439
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB LONNIGHT STEP090
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0014.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY LON0014C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==TX==.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> MAXIMUM TERM IN YEARS
    05 TERM-CAP           PIC 9(2) VALUE ZERO.
    *> LOAN ELIGIBILITY Y/N
    05 LOAN-ELIGIBLE      PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM LOAN-TERM-RULES
    DISPLAY "TERM-CAP=" TERM-CAP
    DISPLAY "LOAN-ELIGIBLE=" LOAN-ELIGIBLE
    STOP RUN.
LOAN-TERM-RULES.
    IF TX-CLNT-AGE >= 18
        EVALUATE TRUE
            *> SHORT TERM FOR OLDER BORROWERS
            WHEN TX-CLNT-AGE GREATER THAN 60
                MOVE 10 TO TERM-CAP
                MOVE 'Y' TO LOAN-ELIGIBLE
            *> MEDIUM TERM CAP
            WHEN TX-CLNT-AGE > 55
                MOVE 20 TO TERM-CAP
                MOVE 'Y' TO LOAN-ELIGIBLE
            WHEN OTHER
                MOVE 30 TO TERM-CAP
                MOVE 'Y' TO LOAN-ELIGIBLE
        END-EVALUATE
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO LOAN-ELIGIBLE
    END-IF.
